Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Password Policies|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: View User Account Lockout
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|quarantine|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Password Policies|
	And PasswordPoliciesNavigator goto Policy
		|passwordPolicyName|Default Password Policy|
	And PasswordPolicies enable Default Password Policy Lockout
		|passwordPolicyName|Default Password Policy|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Password Policies|
	And PasswordPoliciesNavigator goto Policy
		|passwordPolicyName|Default Password Policy|
	And PasswordPolicies view Default Password Policy Lockout
		|passwordPolicyName|Default Password Policy|
	And User logout PG
	And User login Until Account Lockout
		|maximumFailure|3|
	And User login User PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User unlock User Account
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And User logout PG
	Then User login User PG